{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0a6801810d404474761cee68892e693470f779efdaeb92fe974c8e6e0e62676d", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影がある。\nひなたの様子はどうだろう？）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《爱格拉！！》。\n不知道日向现在怎么样了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "12af34d4366eba3cfa5f4c5ae561162634654bb22f5643dc9df7b24f3ced94a3", "ja": "うぅ、{$P$}……。\n今、ちょっこしいいかい？", "zh": "呜呜，{$P$}……\n现在能稍微打扰一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4fca1f05efa16dd4f1a368c4167086a128df27f302b16aaca7b996a99c638d4f", "ja": "ひなた、お疲れさま。\n……どうしたんだ？　なんだかもじもじして。", "zh": "日向，辛苦了。\n……怎么了？看起来有点扭扭捏捏的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "f3e10e535449d7899b3792b8490c273caa5c2aa6a3114ad8d78cdd774a954c74", "ja": "実は、その……この衣装、\nちゃんとあたしに似合ってるかねえ？", "zh": "其实，那个……这套服装，\n真的适合我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "7c0de99c7752a21b9b12bb1feb90866364858e9648bc2c179ae489e49325e9e3", "ja": "あたし、ちゃんと東京のウェイトレスっぽく\n見えてるかい？　なんだか落ち着かなくて……。", "zh": "我看起来像个正宗的东京女服务生吗？总觉得有点坐立不安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7d85e2a91ee6cdeff81e5488004d216bb6fcbedc6dfe8a96addc292b8581ead0", "ja": "いや、大丈夫。よく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "不，没问题。很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "4f82cda2c6a38351a1925cf4546ec153ad8ba29d0d3e5167cf13ebff72d254ba", "ja": "うう、そう言ってくれるのは、\nとってもありがたいんだけども……。", "zh": "呜呜，您能这么说，\n我真的很感激，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "a813fc85b91388a826b7de10501663291024dd215751e6210c53c976e6ba6fb8", "ja": "このカフェもなまらおしゃれだし、\nやっぱり緊張してしまって……。", "zh": "这家咖啡馆也时髦得不得了，果然还是会紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "f141e37bcf63c63d02d207e958a454719c4d647db0cf655082f5f8d1b3cc7f29", "ja": "めんこい衣装着せてもらえるのも、おしゃれな場所で\n撮影してもらえるのも、すっごく嬉しいんだけども。", "zh": "能穿上可爱的服装，能在这么时髦的地方\n拍照，我也觉得特别开心，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "291cea72e8fe56ec1482979a5b0c86922db58d57e8d4b2729a8de128f75d5d84", "ja": "だからよけいに、あたしが馴染めてないのが\n申し訳ない気がして……。", "zh": "所以，反而觉得自己没能融入其中，心里很过意不去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1010_p", "source_sha256": "332d686a1464fdb16856a3f3abd9f3c4640e367b69d9c19c596d3a47862721c0", "ja": "（いつもと違う雰囲気の撮影に、\n気おくれしてしまっているみたいだな……）", "zh": "（看来她是因为这次拍摄的氛围与平时不同，而有些畏缩了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1021_p", "source_sha256": "8783fb8905c873913f836767e347bf5199e4a008c129703ba954ff33e279a59e", "ja": "……よし！　じゃあひなた、ちょっと\nこっちに来てもらっていいか？", "zh": "……好！那小日向，你能先到这边来一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e0f6367c176364cfc604589186e5fca872a969c31480fbb1bd9889a8027db619", "ja": "そうそう、そのあたりで……。\nお店の前に、ポーズとって立ってもらっていいか？", "zh": "对对，就站那儿……。\n能请你在店门前摆个姿势站好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "ddcd5a61b0814dd7e0ee5145f3dff40b83bfb97a7034a1ddaf40216e1ef53683", "ja": "お店の前に？　こ、こうかい……？", "zh": "要站在店门口？这、这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1013_p", "source_sha256": "7b16fb33936ad8247180f4f8d2c7560537e69f6e80ebe6454eac1369ef98e4b5", "ja": "うん、やっぱりこうやって見るとピッタリだよ。\n衣装もキマってて、おしゃれな感じだ。", "zh": "嗯，这样一看果然很合适。\n服装也很合身，感觉很时髦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "79640b4c1e808ccc7f6b504572ec24b1821da1f0e1b17bcb3394b36904149251", "ja": "え……ほ、本当かい？\nあたし、浮いてしまってないかい？", "zh": "诶……真、真的吗？\n我没有显得格格不入吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1fafa88a657f2236fab87650190c90df2aceb796eeb58f6098d177c62d2a6f84", "ja": "本当だよ。なにより、ウェイトレスに大切なのは、\nお客さんをもてなそうとする気持ちだと思うんだ。", "zh": "是真的。我觉得对女服务员来说，最重要的是想要好好招待客人的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f6532fd13401077b726f6684c3fa338857b085661fdbb3fcb9e973704f8385e3", "ja": "だからこそ、今回の仕事にひなたを選んだんだよ。\nひなたなら、そういう気持ちが出せると思って。", "zh": "正因为如此，我才选择让日向来做这次的工作。我觉得日向一定能表达出那样的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "17ba59cd9ebef05f9a494750d5e8ad65e488cb18d2266dff3f4ac179c0cceb02", "ja": "そっかぁ……確かにあたし、劇場に来てくれる人を、\nおもてなししたいと思ってるかもねぇ。", "zh": "这样啊……确实，我可能也想好好招待来到剧场的客人们吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "238c1eed52d0689ddaf8ce228a55cd65dc0d60852d1ce340cd30d8d1559cc139", "ja": "それに、{$P$}があたしを選んで\nくれたんだもんなぁ……うん、自信が湧いてきたよぉ！", "zh": "而且，{$P$}还选中了我嘛……嗯，我越来越有自信了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "f0f0ffe4c492488f92d662cb726a540c15c37f57689cd75fb5b867de42b20bd8", "ja": "いらっしゃいませ、焼き立てのアップルパイは\nいかがかなぁ？　なんて……えへへ♪", "zh": "欢迎光临，要不要来份刚出炉的苹果派呀？开玩笑的……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0223_1020_p", "source_sha256": "8533662639e5525e90e6c8d527990e77f218937a908330b032fc03478eb59794", "ja": "（うん、いつものひなたらしい雰囲気が出てきた。\nこれなら今日の撮影も、きっと上手くいくだろう！）", "zh": "（嗯，已经有平时日向的感觉了。\n这样的话，今天的拍摄一定也能顺利进行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
